{"articleNo":"499961","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=499961&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[장학] 2024년 하반기 신안군장학재단 장학생 선발 안내","writer":"학생성공과","writeDate":"2024.10.14","hit":"6291","attachments":[{"name":"2024년 하반기 장학생 선발 안내문(요약본).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=499961&attachNo=137817"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">▣ (재)신안군장학재단에서 군민의 교육적 부담을 줄이고 우수 인재를 양성하고자 2024년 하반기 장학생을 선발하고 있으니 해당 학생들의 많은 신청 바랍니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 18.5pt; text-indent: -18.5pt; text-align: left;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한컴돋움;font-family:한컴돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:한컴돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:13.0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:한컴돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:한컴돋움;font-weight:bold;font-size:13.0pt;\">지원절차 및 일정</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 18.5pt; text-indent: -18.5pt; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -41.6pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 한컴돋움;\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -41.6pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 한컴돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"text-indent: -41.6pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 한컴돋움;\">공고 및 신청 접수       </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -41.6pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 한컴돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: 24. 10. 10.(</span><span style=\"text-indent: -41.6pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 한컴돋움;\">목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -41.6pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 한컴돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">) ~ 10. 25.(</span><span style=\"text-indent: -41.6pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 한컴돋움;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -41.6pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 한컴돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 18.5pt; text-indent: -18.5pt; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -41.6pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 한컴돋움;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -41.6pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 한컴돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"text-indent: -41.6pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 한컴돋움;\">서류 심사 및 이사회 심의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -41.6pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 한컴돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: 24. 10. 28.(</span><span style=\"text-indent: -41.6pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 한컴돋움;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -41.6pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 한컴돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">) ~ 11</span><span style=\"text-indent: -41.6pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 한컴돋움;\">월 중</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 18.5pt; text-indent: -18.5pt; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -41.6pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 한컴돋움;\">다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -41.6pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 한컴돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"text-indent: -41.6pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 한컴돋움;\">대상자 통보 장학금 지급 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -41.6pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 한컴돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: 24. 11</span><span style=\"text-indent: -41.6pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 한컴돋움;\">월 중</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 18.5pt; text-indent: -18.5pt; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -41.6pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 한컴돋움;\">라. 기타사항: 붙임 안내문 참조</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: HY중고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt;\">※ </span><span style=\"font-family: HY중고딕; font-size: 13pt;\">위 일정은 재단 사정에 따라 다소 변경될 수 있음</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: HY중고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt;\">.</span><br></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
